#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:5
msgid "Preventing Credit Card Fraud – HSBC HK"
msgstr "提防信用卡詐騙 - 香港滙豐"

#: frontend/templates/android-malware-safety-measures.html:13
msgid "Cyber security and fraud hub"
msgstr "網路安全及防詐騙資訊中心"

#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:11
msgid "Preventing Credit Card Fraud"
msgstr "保障信用卡／扣賬卡安全"

#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:19
msgid "Better safe than sorry"
msgstr "保護自己，防範未然"

#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:20
msgid ""
"Credit cards are a popular payment choice, but that also makes them a "
"target for fraudsters. Credit card fraud can involve unauthorised use, "
"lost or stolen cards, fraudulent applications, and suspicious online or "
"mail order transactions."
msgstr "平時購物以信用卡付款越見普及，平均一個人就有兩張信用卡。但同時亦會令騙徒有機可乘，用五花八門的技倆盜用您的信用卡"

#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:21
msgid ""
"Here are some tips to help you protect yourself from falling victim to "
"credit card fraud."
msgstr "以下我們為您提供多項用卡安全小貼士，保護自己免受信用卡詐騙威脅。"

#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:25
msgid "Authenticating online transactions with HSBC HK App"
msgstr "透過HSBC HK App安全認證網上交易"

#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:26
msgid ""
"From March 2024, you can authenticate your online transactions more "
"securely using the HSBC HK App Online Transaction Authentication Service."
" If you have the app and are registered for mobile banking, you’ll be "
"asked to authenticate online transactions via the app instead of SMS OTP,"
" which is safer and more convenient."
msgstr ""
"由2024年3月起，您可以使用香港滙豐流動理財應用程式網上交易認證服務，認證您的網上交易。如您已安裝HSBC HK "
"App及登記滙豐流動理財，您毋須再以短訊收取一次性驗證碼，並可使用HSBC HK App更安全便捷地認證您的網上交易。"

#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:28
msgid "Update your HSBC HK App to the latest version"
msgstr "更新HSBC HK App至最新版本"

#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:29
msgid "Activate and verify your Mobile Security Key"
msgstr "啟動及驗證流動保安編碼"

#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:34
msgid "Card Fraud Alert"
msgstr "使用信用卡／扣賬卡前，多一分留心"

#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:35
msgid ""
"HSBC will notify you via the app or SMS if a suspicious transaction is "
"detected. Always verify the merchant, payment amount, currency, date, and"
" time before responding. Let HSBC know if you did not make the "
"transaction."
msgstr "如果我們發現您的信用卡／扣賬卡出現可疑交易，就會向您發送信用卡／扣賬卡可疑交易通知"

#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:39
msgid "Turn on push notifications"
msgstr "在HSBC HK App上開啟推播通知"

#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:41
msgid "Open the HSBC HK App and select the menu icon, then the profile icon."
msgstr "點擊選單圖示，然後點選頭像圖示。"

#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:42
msgid "Find 'Settings and preferences', select 'Communication preferences'."
msgstr "到「設定及喜好設定」點選「通訊喜好設定」。"

#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:43
msgid "Switch on push notifications for 'Transactions & Services'."
msgstr "開啓「銀行交易及服務」推播通知。"

#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:48
msgid "Safeguarding yourself when using your card"
msgstr "使用信用卡／扣賬卡時，提高警覺性"

#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:50
msgid ""
"Shop only at secure, trustworthy websites. Check for 'https' and a "
"padlock icon in the address bar."
msgstr "確保網購平台安全可"

#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:51
msgid ""
"Use the HSBC HK App Online Transaction Authentication Service at "
"supported merchants."
msgstr "以更安全可靠的方式認證網上交"

#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:52
msgid ""
"When you receive an OTP, check all details (merchant, time, amount) "
"before acting."
msgstr "清楚檢查一次性密碼短"

#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:53
msgid ""
"Review your transactions regularly via the app or card statements. Ensure"
" you recognise every transaction."
msgstr "定期查閱信用卡／扣賬卡賬"

#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:54
msgid ""
"Never disclose banking credentials or card details. Fraudsters may "
"impersonate real organisations and use phishing messages, fake websites, "
"calls, or malicious links to trick you."
msgstr "千萬不要透露敏感個人資"

#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:59
msgid "Reporting suspicious activities"
msgstr "發現可疑交易，即通知我們"

#: frontend/templates/credit-card-fraud-alert.html:60
msgid ""
"If you see a transaction you don't recognise, you can place a temporary "
"block on your card or file a report with HSBC."
msgstr "對某些交易紀錄沒有印象？不要慌張，您可以暫時封鎖信用卡／扣賬卡，同時再三檢查您的交易紀錄或向我們舉報可疑交易。"

